  "arrangerNotes": "Refrain only, verified against the LilyPond score on Italian Wikipedia (top voice of the refrain, which carries the refrain words; German note names). The verse is left out because it has chromatic A naturals. 6/8 time (eighth = 0.5 beat); the score's rests are kept. No simplification needed. D drum: as written (range 1 to high 2), D minLayout 13. C drum: the C drum has no high 2, so the four notes of ''ncoppa, jamme' are played one octave lower; C minLayout 11. C and D arrangements differ where noted above (each fits its own drum).",
  "verified": true
